hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1754","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak mota taaza aadmi Qiyaamat key din aaeyga jo Allah key paas machhar key par baraabar wazan na rakkheyga. Aur farmaya: Padho: (To ham Qiyaamat key din unkey liye wazan na rakkhengey). (Bukhari: 4729). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur unhey hasrat key din se daraao)."
